"entity": {
"name": "A.P. Moller - Maersk A/S",
"description": "A.P. Moller-Maersk A/S engages in shipping, energy, transportation, offshore drilling, and retail activities. It operates through the following segments: Ocean, Logistics and Services, and Terminals. The Ocean segment includes global container shipping activities including strategic transhipment hubs and sale of bunker oil. The Logistics and Services segment comprises freight forwarding, supply chain management, inland haulage, and other logistics services. The Terminals segment focuses in the gateway terminal activities, towage, and related marine activities. The company was founded by Arnold Peter Moller and Peter Maersk Moller on April 16, 1904 and is headquartered in Copenhagen, Denmark.",
